00:24:04.080 --> 00:24:05.860
Really? I can't tell there's a difference.

00:24:06.280 --> 00:24:09.680
Huh? Nadoka-chan? We've been friends for so long, too.

00:24:10.650 --> 00:24:12.590
I can't find it. I can't find it.

00:24:12.730 --> 00:24:13.410
Hey there, sis.

00:24:13.770 --> 00:24:15.690
I had a smile in elementary school.

00:24:15.890 --> 00:24:17.650
I was too nervous in middle school.

00:24:17.900 --> 00:24:19.660
But I'm not gonna mess up this time.
